acceptance_criteria: "Reproduce 2026.10.8, 2026.10.9 and current SDK against isolated exact downstream data; distinguish historical reviewed receipt proof from unreviewed decisions; preserve immutable evidence and unchanged bytes on refusals; any force review guidance names its audit requirements; independent regressions and all-source coverage pass."
